{"unit_id":"Fisfzy__dsh-ego-browser#card-zh","repo":"Fisfzy/dsh-ego-browser","commit":"ce67518adf10894584ebfc39353c730bdee88046","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ego-browser 是 DSH 插件，为 agent 提供内置 ego-lite Chromium 浏览器和结构化自动化工具。它通过 DSH 工具与 subprocess 接口驱动任务空间，可读取语义页面快照、导航、点击、填写表单、管理标签、等待页面事件并上传或下载文件；网页端还提供实时观察面板，支持截图画面、鼠标键盘接管和标签切换。适合需要让 agent 浏览、操作并检查网页的 DSH 用户。需要 Node.js 22 和 Chrome/Chromium/Edge；FFmpeg 捕获为可选配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:2091","src/index.ts:1599","src/client/index.ts:1410","src/worker/ego-cast-worker.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Fisfzy__dsh-ego-browser#card-en","repo":"Fisfzy/dsh-ego-browser","commit":"ce67518adf10894584ebfc39353c730bdee88046","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"ego-browser gives DSH agents an ego-lite Chromium browser and tools to inspect pages, navigate, click, fill forms, manage tabs, wait for events, and transfer files. Its web panel adds live viewing and direct mouse and keyboard control. It requires Node.js 22 and Chrome, Chromium, or Edge.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:2091","src/index.ts:1599","src/client/index.ts:1410","src/worker/ego-cast-worker.ts:1"]}
